ed team sports business that has partnerships with the National Football League, National Basketball Association, Major League Baseball, and National Hockey League, as well as U.S. colleges and universities. It distributes its products through retailers, digital channels, and online retail partners. G-III Apparel Group, Ltd. was founded in 1956 and is based in New York, New York."}}